## llama.cpp / ggml

`kernels/src/cuda/mmq_q4.cuh` adapts packed loaders and fragments from
`mmq-load-tiles.cuh`, `mmq-vec-dot.cuh` and `mma.cuh` in llama.cpp at commit
`c479922ac520a08969b4c1dc154d7bbb3c386d85`. Its existing MIT header is retained.
The terms below apply to that upstream material and its adaptations.

Other files name llama.cpp as the basis they were written after:
`crates/larch-model/src/tokenizer.rs` ports llama.cpp's byte-level BPE and SPM
tokenizers, and the Metal mat-vec kernels in `kernels/src/metal/ops.metal` follow
`ggml-metal.metal`'s `kernel_mul_mv_q4_K_f32`, `_q5_K_f32`, `_q6_K_f32`,
`mul_mv_ext`, `mul_mv_mma` and `kernel_mul_mm`. The terms below apply to any
