## NVIDIA CUDA libraries

Release builds for NVIDIA GPUs carry cuBLAS (`cublas`, `cublasLt`) and nvJitLink
(`nvJitLink`) libraries from NVIDIA's CUDA redistributable archives, downloaded
at release time from https://developer.download.nvidia.com/compute/cuda/redist/
and checked against the hashes NVIDIA publishes. They are not in this
repository and are not licensed under the Apache License. NVIDIA distributes them
under the NVIDIA CUDA Toolkit End User License Agreement
(https://docs.nvidia.com/cuda/eula/), whose Attachment A lists them as
redistributable with an application. The CUDA runtime package installs them in
Larch's own runtime folder with NVIDIA's license text beside them
(`libcublas-LICENSE.txt`, `libnvjitlink-LICENSE.txt`).

